-- built an `ALTER TABLE ... ADD CONSTRAINT ... DEFAULT` through sp_executesql,
-- guarded on sys.default_constraints. PostgreSQL has no batch variables, no named
-- default constraints, and no sys.default_constraints, so a token-for-token
-- transpile was never going to exist -- the equivalent is a DO block that reads
